"created_at":"2026-10-16T12:16:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111068714644992407"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":4,"start":0,"tag":"TSM"}]},"id":"2111068714644992407","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#TSM - Taiwan is preparing tighter export controls on AI chips to China 👀","url":"https://x.com/KOCtrades/status/2111068714644992407"},{"author_id":"361492284","created_at":"2026-10-17T05:47:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111333282680119462"],"id":"2111333282680119462","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI is going global. The technology behind it is becoming more national.\n\nChina just proposed new AI export controls. The US restricts advanced chips.\n\nFor builders, model selection is becoming more than a technical decision. It’s a geopolitical one.","url":"https://x.com/filippo_rovelli/status/2111333282680119462"},{"author_id":"1391383085623783429","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:19:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111069523944124632"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/BRICSinfo/stat…","end":148,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/BRICSinfo/status/2111023242228146275","start":125,"url":"https://t.co/rvlTC3wRiD"}]},"id":"2111069523944124632","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Export controls on AI models, chips, and agents all at once. Who still thinks the global AI supply chain 'decouples nicely'? https://t.co/rvlTC3wRiD","url":"https://x.com/Awais786Muhamd/status/2111069523944124632"},{"author_id":"1887524182725996544","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:26:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111252591673847922"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Debate is flaring in the U.S. about whether political and policy uncertainty is threatening the dollar’s status as the world’s most important currency. In the European Union, there’s a different dilemma: how to secure a broader role for the euro in international transactions.","display_url":"politico.com/newsletters/mo…","end":273,"expanded_url":"https://www.politico.com/newsletters/morning-money","images":[{"height":2617,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111252636515123200/r3iM6NcC?format=jpg&name=orig","width":5001},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111252636515123200/r3iM6NcC?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":250,"status":200,"title":"Morning Money","unwound_url":"https://www.politico.com/newsletters/morning-money","url":"https://t.co/OUvBl7fYYv"}]},"id":"2111252591673847922","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":129,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I interviewed Sen. Moreno for MM about chips and AI export controls, and how lawmakers are divided. \n\n“On advanced chips, I don’t think there’s consensus around that. For example, I disagree that we should do [export control of] the advanced chips.\n\nhttps://t.co/OUvBl7fYYv","url":"https://x.com/hapgoodreports/status/2111252591673847922"},{"author_id":"597517815","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:28:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110981207899119800"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Taiwan is preparing to tighten export controls on AI chips to further align with US restrictions, according to a senior official in Taipei, joining a Trump administration clampdown on the smuggling of cutting-edge semiconductors to China.","display_url":"bloomberg.com/news/articles/…","end":141,"expanded_url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-16/taiwan-to-curb-ai-chip-exports-to-china-as-part-of-us-trade-deal?utm_source=website&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=twitter","images":[{"height":800,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110973725575454721/-se87ULG?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110973725575454721/-se87ULG?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":118,"status":200,"title":"Taiwan to Curb AI Chip Exports to China as Part of US Trade Deal","unwound_url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-16/taiwan-to-curb-ai-chip-exports-to-china-as-part-of-us-trade-deal?utm_source=website&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=twitter","url":"https://t.co/KZNxtRKlIC"}]},"id":"2110981207899119800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2458,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Taiwan plans to tighten export controls on AI chips to further align with US restrictions and curb smuggling to China https://t.co/KZNxtRKlIC","url":"https://x.com/staunovo/status/2110981207899119800"},{"author_id":"762768572263399425","created_at":"2026-10-17T03:50:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111303935600341131"],"id":"2111303935600341131","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Geopolitics and AI:\n\nThe market's hottest trade just round-tripped. Goldman's momentum basket was up 70% in late June. Now it's negative for the year. Same week, Beijing proposed export controls on AI models and chips. AI now trades as a geopolitical asset, not just a growth","url":"https://x.com/theinvestorbrfg/status/2111303935600341131"},{"author_id":"420938460","created_at":"2026-10-16T09:44:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111030623486034383"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Taiwan is preparing to tighten export controls on AI chips to further align with US restrictions, according to a senior official in Taipei, joining a Trump administration clampdown on the smuggling of cutting-edge semiconductors to China.","display_url":"bloomberg.com/news/articles/…","end":141,"expanded_url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-16/taiwan-to-curb-ai-chip-exports-to-china-as-part-of-us-trade-deal?utm_source=website&utm_medium=sha